Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,=======TEXT=======
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.71,0:00:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}新的一天早晨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.88,0:00:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是一个夹杂着期待与不安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.29,0:00:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感觉还有点小鹿乱撞的 新的一天的早晨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.02,0:00:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我要出发咯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}姐姐 今天几点回来？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.81,0:00:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我要准备晚饭哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.65,0:00:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}说不定会晚一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.32,0:00:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因为有 社团活动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}从今天开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我就是火箭研究社的部长了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.26,0:00:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Bonavuu！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.74,0:00:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}噢~今天比之前更加元气满满呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}正因为我是部长嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真期待放学之后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.85,0:00:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}又是她俩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那俩额头少女啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.71,0:02:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呃 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你俩天天用碰额头来打招呼的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.78,0:02:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}让我感到很羞耻 不许再做了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.05,0:02:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你是说「额门感应」？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谁知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.31,0:02:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遥乃 还有你也要注意点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬 你要不也来试试「额门感应」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那玩意难道不奇怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.37,0:02:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}试着在脑海中想象你喜欢的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.17,0:02:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喜欢的事物？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就这样贴在你的额门上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虽然我不知道瞬在想什么喜欢的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.11,0:02:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是 如果让幽来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.47,0:02:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我知道啦 我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就如同心有灵犀一般地知晓了一切
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.46,0:02:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是这种 很厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.81,0:03:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}绝对什么也不知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.49,0:03:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我怎么会和这种骗人的丸子天线头交朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谁是骗人的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.51,0:03:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我可是正宗外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.35,0:03:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是是是 好人设
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.26,0:03:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊啦？老师的会议差不多就要结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.19,0:03:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要来了吗 最终结果
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}算了 那么呕心沥血写的申请书
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.38,0:03:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}100%会通过的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.97,0:03:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}终于要来了 社团活动
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.99,0:03:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}同？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.98,0:03:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.99,0:03:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}会？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.05,0:03:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对不起 孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}老师已经尽力了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.24,0:03:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是社团活动是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.40,0:03:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么叫「社团活动成绩不足」啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.02,0:03:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说过绝对能行的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然后资金呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.71,0:03:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}0
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}活动室呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}放学后的空教室
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.72,0:03:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}指导老师呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.81,0:03:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}解散吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我已经尽我全能了
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.08,0:03:55.31,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}别那样说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.35,0:03:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}毕竟拿不到钱 就没有意义啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.63,0:03:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且老师你教的科目
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.72,0:03:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是体育吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.87,0:04:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是现代文啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}和火箭完全没关系啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.90,0:04:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我…我觉得还行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.13,0:04:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}同…同好会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.64,0:04:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}「社团活动成绩」什么的…今后去做就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}说不定就可以被认定为社团了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.41,0:04:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想 想和大家一起试试看呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎…怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.91,0:04:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也有一定道理
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}算了 既然会长大人发话了 也就没什么好说的了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.07,0:04:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}会…？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.98,0:04:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你从部长晋升了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.01,0:04:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果会长
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.24,0:04:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好啊 孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.47,0:04:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家一起以晋级社团为目标而努力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.32,0:04:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}为了这么努力的你们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}老师准备了小礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.09,0:04:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么 好吃的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.55,0:04:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.83,0:04:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}铛铛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.61,0:04:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}礼轻情意重嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你这礼也太轻了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.53,0:04:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虽然我已经是老师了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.87,0:04:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可我还是要还大学时候的助学贷款
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.20,0:04:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}很辛苦的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是瞬弄哭她的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是我不好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是 就算可以接受同好会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}活动室要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.71,0:05:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因为要造东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以必须找一个车间
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.63,0:05:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我的家可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.19,0:05:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.09,0:05:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的假的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的假的！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.01,0:05:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这不是秘密基地吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.19,0:05:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是秘密基地哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.07,0:05:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么样 瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.51,0:05:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}吓了一大跳吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.84,0:05:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谁 谁知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.61,0:05:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遥乃也不介意了 我们就用这个灯塔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}为什么是遥乃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.17,0:05:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}本来是我的祖父在管理这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}现在已经废弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}现在这里谁也不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以嘛 我觉得没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.41,0:05:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你可真是大胆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.05,0:05:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}等等
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说这里已经废弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这不是还通着电吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.59,0:05:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你不会是在偷电吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}其实呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:06:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}祖父从这里离开之后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}应该是断了所有的电的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}自从幽来了之后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.53,0:06:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不知道怎么的就又通上电了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这就是外星人的力量啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.19,0:06:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊哈噗哈哈噗哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.99,0:06:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是有发电机吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.39,0:06:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}过一会去机房调查一下吧
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.43,0:06:18.54,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家 拿杯子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.09,0:06:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}为我们同好会的诞生干杯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.41,0:06:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}外星也有这种文化吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.73,0:06:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Vui！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果会长
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}来说几句吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我…我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是新官上任呢 海果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好好发挥哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我会…努力做好会长的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这样我就能帮助明内你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家正在兴头上 再喝再喝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.29,0:06:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.03,0:06:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}再来点小吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}来一点就好…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.73,0:06:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哎呀 手抖了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.49,0:07:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果的话 一定能行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.67,0:07:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}成为大家的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.23,0:07:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最近 姐姐经常用家里的电脑调查东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.22,0:07:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个电脑小白姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}诶 这个是雷门同学的火箭？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.15,0:07:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}上了高中之后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就感觉变了个人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.45,0:07:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}穗波 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我想要打印这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.03,0:07:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可它怎么变成PFD了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好像也没变啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.48,0:07:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天又是经典的瞬的风格呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}天丸闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}「天丸」？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.67,0:07:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}天线丸子头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.53,0:07:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}的缩写就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.71,0:07:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}天丸！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你脸上的伤是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.85,0:07:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只是被老爸扔过来的扳手不小心碰了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}「扳手」？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:07:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}「只是」？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}难道是你为了比赛 偷你老爸的发动机的火药
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}被你老爸发现了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嘿嘿 瞬应该是被狠狠训了一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.47,0:08:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没被训
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只是吵了一架
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.17,0:08:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我本来以为是玩具枪的火药
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.19,0:08:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且我自己也挺小心的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就觉得没事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.32,0:08:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}算了 反正已经解决了 没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.46,0:08:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真 真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.07,0:08:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我用C型钳子把我的老爸钳回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.21,0:08:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}安全意识在哪里…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.21,0:08:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}总之
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}开始做吧 火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.34,0:08:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}用安全的工具和正确的知识来做的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谁做都可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.23,0:08:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没错 你们也行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.11,0:08:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}安全的工具？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.77,0:08:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在这
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.72,0:08:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}正确的知识呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}肯定是我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.07,0:08:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.13,0:08:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这次是老爸同意的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.12,0:08:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了 海果
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.86,0:09:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}终于要开始做火药火箭了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.92,0:09:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太过高兴…所以说不出…话来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.39,0:09:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}做之前就这幅德行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.14,0:09:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天要让你们每人制作一发火箭并发射
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}火箭模型？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.63,0:09:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就和我在比赛中用的那个一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.78,0:09:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是用火药来发射的迷你火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.51,0:09:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也有官方的世界大赛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.91,0:09:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}其实很想买一套部件来着…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.93,0:09:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好厉害 有很多种火箭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}甚 甚至还带降落伞…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.47,0:09:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谁让我们只有3000日元的资金呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.17,0:09:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瓶制火箭的推进力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.38,0:09:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}来自于喷水给到的反作用力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.84,0:09:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而这个也是差不多一样的道理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.53,0:09:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}发动机在燃烧的时候会向下喷出气体
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在反作用之下火箭就会飞起来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.11,0:09:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这就是你说的发动机？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}比想象的还要普通
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但这个可是能飞100米以上的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.62,0:09:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要是有更强力的发动机的话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.33,0:10:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还能轻而易举地飞这个的十倍往上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.31,0:10:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}十…十倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.45,0:10:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}模型火箭的发动机
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.09,0:10:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}根据总推力积的多少
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.21,0:10:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}用英文字母排序
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.05,0:10:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这次我们用的是最小型的A型
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}诶 A的后面还跟有数字…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.94,0:10:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看这个型号的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.33,0:10:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就能明白这个发动机的持续时间和发动时间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.34,0:10:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遥乃 算一算从点火到降落伞打开之前需要多少时间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.18,0:10:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}2.5除以8再加3…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}3.3125秒吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.01,0:10:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是吧 很简单吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一点也不简单吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}借我脑子用用
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Mupipi
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.39,0:10:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}额头作战成功！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}脑子要坏掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.41,0:10:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}牛是力的单位…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.51,0:10:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}记录记录
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.13,0:10:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要是想在火箭里搭载降落伞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:11:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就要防止火药燃烧的热量将其熔化
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.56,0:11:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}轻轻地放进去 不能把它压扁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最后再吹气
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.51,0:11:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真外行啊 给我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.32,0:11:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要用嘴把整个入口都盖住
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.49,0:11:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不 还是你自己来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.53,0:11:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最后是发动机的设置
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.48,0:11:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}为了能用电点着火
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.15,0:11:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就得让点火器接触发动机的火药
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}火药…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.26,0:11:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}当心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.51,0:11:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}用力不对的话 会爆炸的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}爆…爆…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.87,0:11:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是要是有一点没做好的话 就会变成哑火的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.43,0:11:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要好好连接上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.39,0:11:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好…好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的是靠我们自己做出来的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.63,0:11:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}当然的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.91,0:11:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊…好累…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}脑袋里已经一堆浆糊了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.73,0:12:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.65,0:12:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}毕竟才是第1次做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}后面再抽几次空 详细教你们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.95,0:12:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天 嗯…讲的是有点太超纲了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.43,0:12:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.53,0:12:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不会的 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.04,0:12:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这下大家就可以一起造模型火箭了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.39,0:12:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天真的谢谢你 雷门同学
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬的话题感觉好无聊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对吧 感觉跟个男孩子似的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.32,0:12:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}诶…但我还是想要那堆乱糟糟的数字
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬再借我一下额头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}算术练习册我倒是可以借你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.85,0:12:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我应该己经 学会了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.11,0:12:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可 可以的话 让我来教…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.97,0:12:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不 不行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.52,0:13:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我的记性可不是很好哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.73,0:13:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一次可不太够哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.75,0:13:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.57,0:13:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看这边 海果会长有重要的发表
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.11,0:13:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以说别在别人面前做这种事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}下 下个月 有 有一个模型火箭的活动
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.62,0:13:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.31,0:13:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我在电脑上看雷门同学的火箭 就找到了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}作 作为同好会 大家一起去怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.75,0:13:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}赞成赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 学校那天也是周末
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.11,0:13:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯？也有大型模型火箭的发射演示
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.45,0:13:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今 今天也学了很多 可以巩固一下学的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.24,0:13:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}发射 发射！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}模型火箭的大发射！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.30,0:13:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}与其唱这么傻的歌 还不如练练发射的口号
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}发射准备 完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没有低空飞行物体
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}开始倒计时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}5 4 3 2…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.62,0:14:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.66,0:14:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}由于天气不良 发射中止
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你要留下来过夜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}号 号码！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}1
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}2
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}3
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.10,0:14:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}4
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.18,0:14:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}5！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.39,0:14:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}藤野岬高中火箭研究同好会
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.73,0:14:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}出发！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.14,0:14:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}以为是来远足的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.63,0:14:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就像庆典一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.88,0:14:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人还真是意外的多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.84,0:14:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}毕竟是和美食节同时举办的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.12,0:14:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}来享受美食的客人也很多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.61,0:14:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嘛 在主菜的发射演示之前打发一下时间也行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}笑原老师 有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.21,0:14:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我好像有几个熟人也来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.57,0:14:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那我们就自己在这边逛一逛就好了 老师请随意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.03,0:15:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呃…这不行 监护人怎么能在远足途中自己跑掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.16,0:15:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这不是远足 你就随意来吧 而且你也不是监护人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.48,0:15:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那我们要去哪里逛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.94,0:15:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}抱歉 有撞到哪里吗 有没有受伤
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.18,0:15:15.17,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对对对 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}给我们塑料瓶的人
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.06,0:15:19.77,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找塑料瓶的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.31,0:15:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找塑料瓶的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们的熟人？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.25,0:15:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是之前为塑料瓶火箭比赛找材料时遇到的人
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.71,0:15:27.32,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没想到居然还能再遇到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.65,0:15:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们也来这里了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}唔嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好久不见 谢谢你之前的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}得好好说谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.02,0:15:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她是好人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.76,0:15:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要打招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你 果然刚才还是撞到哪里了 有哪里不舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.08,0:15:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}之前不是见过一次吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们也是高中生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.31,0:15:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是的 是藤野岬高中的高一
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}藤野高中啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.52,0:15:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我叫秋月彗 是立冈技术高中的高二
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.76,0:15:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}高二生！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}前辈？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.39,0:16:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 啊啊 之前友所布周请请多瓜照
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.92,0:16:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这家伙很有趣吧 不用在意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.81,0:16:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小之星同学 明内同学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.94,0:16:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}宝木同学 雷门同学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.17,0:16:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}再次 请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.91,0:16:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们是为什么来参加这个活动呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.84,0:16:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}当然是为了火箭大发射
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.66,0:16:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}和我一样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.51,0:16:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是在发射演示之前想买点给同伴的小吃
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就逛了一下小吃摊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.93,0:16:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}结果就找不到怎么回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.80,0:16:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在什么都还没买之前
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.57,0:16:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}迷路了么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}和我好像
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可以的话 在找到你朋友之前 我们就一起吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们也会帮忙找的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.47,0:16:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的吗 谢谢 帮忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这里居然有这么多有名的俱乐部的火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不愧是火箭节
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.20,0:16:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 看这里有好多火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.37,0:16:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个不是已经停产了的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.55,0:17:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可以拍照吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.93,0:17:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感觉和瞬会很合得来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.72,0:17:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才不是那么幼稚的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.49,0:17:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那可是前辈哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.92,0:17:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个火箭的尾翼有两个？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个应该是多段式的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}把火药按竖向叠接在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.91,0:17:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}使用完后依次脱离 就可以飞得更高
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.63,0:17:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雷 雷门同学真厉害 知道得好详细
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.58,0:17:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哼 这种程度只是常识了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呐呐  小之果同学
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这边的火箭也可以看看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.36,0:17:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个和刚才的不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.99,0:17:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是将好几个引擎结合在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.62,0:17:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在一次飞行中可以制造出巨大的动力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 真的诶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.95,0:17:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就算是同种类的火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要改变引擎的排列方式和点火方式
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.69,0:17:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就能让火箭呈现出不同的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.93,0:17:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}唔……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.93,0:17:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}请给我一根烤玉米！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.23,0:17:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}烤玉米吗 也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}给大家带的点心就选它吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.85,0:17:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}麻烦也给我三个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.78,0:17:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个…啊嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.14,0:17:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}钱包也忘带了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.23,0:18:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我 我借你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.58,0:18:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这家伙到底是来干嘛的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.09,0:18:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}给 久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}彗酱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}前辈 该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.35,0:18:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.20,0:18:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}能会合真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.69,0:18:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}彗 一会儿再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.41,0:18:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在火箭大发射那里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.55,0:18:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 在火箭大发射那里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.81,0:18:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天的首要节目
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.63,0:18:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大型模型火箭的发射演示
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}现在正式开始
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.31,0:18:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}老师我来拍照片吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.52,0:18:31.76,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天的火箭发射演示的是由去年模型火箭锦标赛的优胜校
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.68,0:18:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}刚才拿到的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.14,0:18:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}由立冈技术高中的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.06,0:18:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}宇宙开发研究部的同学进行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}接下来是代表发言时间
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.46,0:18:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有请高二年级的秋月彗同学
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.29,0:18:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天能被邀请参加如此隆重的活动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.37,0:18:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我十分感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.13,0:18:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是如方才所介绍的社团部长秋月彗
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.09,0:18:55.60,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊…彗同学
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.78,0:18:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在去年的大赛上能获得优胜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.33,0:18:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}作为一名部员我感到十分荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.45,0:19:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}希望今天的发射演示能够满足大家的期望
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好厉害啊 啪咻地~咻啪地飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感觉连宇宙都能去到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.96,0:19:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呐 呐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.17,0:19:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.38,0:19:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也很激动
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.83,0:19:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.64,0:19:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}彗同学
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.66,0:19:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}彗 好厉害 真的好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.63,0:19:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还好成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没想到彗同学居然是代表
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.66,0:20:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是惊喜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊嘞 宣传海报上没写吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哦 对了 还钱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.88,0:20:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呃嗯…放哪去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.19,0:20:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}刚才在台上的真的是彗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 有了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.01,0:20:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今天不还也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.47,0:20:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们也会参加
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.88,0:20:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今年的模型火箭锦标赛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以 下次在赛场上你们输掉的时候再还吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.98,0:20:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.01,0:20:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个主意不错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.49,0:20:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也还想和你们再见面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}三个玉米棒一共九百圆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.96,0:20:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那就先给我记个账吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好好记住哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不然我可能会忘掉…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.41,0:20:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}能看到火箭真是不错呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.69,0:20:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}照片有拍得好的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.89,0:20:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 明内嘴巴张得大大的照片倒是有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.37,0:21:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们也要参加今年的大赛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.69,0:21:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}老师会为你们应援的 加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.30,0:21:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也…我们也能做到那样帅气吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.37,0:21:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}做得到 那是当然
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.67,0:21:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因为有我在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.98,0:21:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.06,0:21:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一起加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}钱 我垫着先还你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是这些地方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.33,0:21:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}特别守规矩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.31,0:23:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}老师 这个照片里的是什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.53,0:23:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是火箭发射活动的时候的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.19,0:23:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看 这里不是拍得有火箭吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.38,0:23:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯…？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.87,0:23:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没有其他的照片吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.79,0:23:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呃 有是有 但这张照片是照得最清楚的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.15,0:23:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就这张？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.07,0:23:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个 我倒是拍得有视频
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果要看的话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哇啊 快给我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.89,0:23:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 老师拍的明内同学的照片的话…
